    {
      "children": [
        {
          "position": [
            64,
            128
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Records arrive shaped for a program rather than for a table, so "
        },
        {
          "position": [
            128,
            137
          ],
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "value": "latency"
        },
        {
          "position": [
            137,
            272
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": "\nis an object and not two columns. Flattening gives it path names — and a\npath is an ordinary field name once it has one, which is why "
