          "type": "inlineCode",
          "value": "region"
        },
        {
          "position": [
            397,
            540
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": " is absent there and\nappears only in the second, so it is appended rather than sorted into\nplace, and the record that never had it reads empty."
